  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AL AGHRAS DAM PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT THE CONSTRUCTION OF THE AL AGHRAS DAM FOR THE SUPPLY OF DRINKING WATER OF THE CITIES OF OUJDA, TAOURIRT AND AJOUN. THE PROJEC  WILL ALSO ENSURE PROTECTION FROM FLOODS AND SILTATION ENSURING REGULAR IRRIGATION FROM MOHAMED 5TH DAM THROUGH THE ZAA VALLEY. IN A SECOND STAGE THE GENERATION OF ELECTRICITY MAY BE ENVISAGED.</narrative>
  </description>
